OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA crisp and frosty start, but
OL,6,Fdry and sunny throughout the day.
OL,7,FAnother cold day, with temperatures a
OL,8,Ffew degrees below average for the time
OL,9,Fof year, but only a light breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FStaying dry and clear this
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with
OL,13,Ftemperatures quickly falling away to
OL,14,Fgive another widespread frost. Cold
OL,15,Fwith light winds and a few mist and
OL,16,Ffog patches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
