OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAnother cold, frosty and
OL,6,Fbright start to Saturday. Patchy cloud
OL,7,Finto the afternoon but remaining dry
OL,8,Fwith plenty of sunny spells. A breeze
OL,9,Fpicking up during the evening. Frost
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,13,Fwill be wet and windy for many, with a
OL,14,Fdrier interlude on Monday before more
OL,15,Fpersistent rain on Tuesday.
OL,16,FTemperatures close to or just below
OL,17,Fthe average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
